Brittani D. McNamee and Mickey E. Gunter. Mineralogy and Optical Mineralogy Laboratory Manual, 2014, 51 pages. [MSA's authorized manual and description](https://msaweb.org/mineralogy-and-optical/).

Complete the full lab sequence: analytical-equipment context, physical/optical properties, identification, and its final projects. The manual was designed around Dyar and Gunter's commercial textbook/DVD and particular specimen/instrument access. Those resources are not supplied by this link. Use the open mineralogy/microscopy books for conceptual preparation and document any substitute examples or unavailable equipment.

The official page makes the manual freely available. Preserve its actual rights and component notices; free access is not a claim that the textbook, DVD, specimens, or every linked resource is included or openly licensed. Authors, year, length, scope, and practical dependencies checked on 29 October 2026. No manual or external mineral/media database is copied here.

